WEBVTT

00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:14.740
( Watch on Kissasia.vip & KonFlix.vip )

00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:11.059
I'd like to invite you,

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:12.619
the press, to join me in witnessing

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:15.540
the latest research results
from Qingniao and Minghui Lab.

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:17.380
Please, follow me.

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:23.740
Thank you for your concern.

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:27.820
Minghui Group has
weathered a century of change.

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:31.059
We once faced a critical choice

00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:33.420
amidst the waves of the times,

00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:37.620
and we invested everything
into a biotech company.

00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:40.499
Now, with Qingniao Group on board,

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:44.459
the industrial synergy
between Minghui and Spark

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:47.259
will revitalize
Minghui's technology sector.

00:00:47.260 --> 00:00:50.099
More importantly, it marks
the realization of an independent

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:55.060
and controllable industrial ecosystem
for our tech enterprises in key areas.

00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:02.459
Hello, Lawyer Fang.

00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:05.499
Regarding Yinghai Group's
unilateral termination

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:07.419
due to unforeseen
compliance risk clauses,

00:01:07.420 --> 00:01:09.139
concerning Qingniao Group's
technical supply,

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:11.780
as their representative,
what is your response?

00:01:16.420 --> 00:01:19.459
In response to Yinghai Group's
malicious breach of contract

00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:22.299
and Raymond Technology's
abuse of market dominance,

00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:25.539
we have begun collecting
and securing evidence.

00:01:25.540 --> 00:01:28.620
We will fully protect
our client's legal rights.

00:01:28.740 --> 00:01:32.220
We also hope that Yinghai Group
and Raymond Technology

00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:34.679
can face the seriousness of the issue.

00:01:34.680 --> 00:01:36.879
=Echoes of Gang City=

00:01:36.880 --> 00:01:42.080
=Episode 25=
(I'm Waiting for You in Gang City)

00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:46.860
Come on.

00:01:47.060 --> 00:01:49.900
To your complete victory.

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:52.340
Because of you.

00:02:12.580 --> 00:02:14.459
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

00:02:14.460 --> 00:02:15.900
A total victory!

00:02:16.140 --> 00:02:17.180
Wait a second.

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:20.059
A video call from our spokesperson.

00:02:20.060 --> 00:02:21.740
- Hello, Best Actress Su.
- Hello, Best Actress Su.

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:24.340
Hi, everyone!

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:28.300
You won't be able to taste
our victory wine, will you?

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:30.859
Don't just pick on me.

00:02:30.860 --> 00:02:32.900
Why didn't you video call them?

00:02:33.260 --> 00:02:35.099
I only called you.

00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:36.179
I just wanted to call you.

00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:37.419
Do you have time now?

00:02:37.420 --> 00:02:38.540
Can we talk privately...

00:03:03.060 --> 00:03:08.670
♪Tonight the rain falls soft and slow♪

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:09.980
Alright.

00:03:11.940 --> 00:03:13.140
Don't drink any more.

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:21.960
♪You turn and look back at me♪

00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:28.530
♪In those same eyes familiar tears
quietly appear♪

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:35.100
♪It feels like we have carried so much♪

00:03:36.380 --> 00:03:41.840
♪So many questions time itself
could not make clear♪

00:03:42.960 --> 00:03:48.280
♪The moment you walked into my life♪

00:03:49.430 --> 00:03:55.260
♪Every dream I had became something
I want with you near♪

00:03:55.630 --> 00:04:02.600
♪How many letters have I written
just for you?♪

00:04:02.710 --> 00:04:08.420
♪If only you could truly hear
what my heart is trying to say♪

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:15.449
♪From this life on
no distance could keep us apart♪

00:04:15.450 --> 00:04:18.329
♪The promise we made♪

00:04:18.330 --> 00:04:22.019
♪Will find its way to be fulfilled
one day♪

00:04:22.020 --> 00:04:28.599
♪But I want more
than just that fleeting gaze♪

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:35.010
♪Still I have not heard your answer♪

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:41.739
♪Can we still rewrite the ending
we face?♪

00:04:41.740 --> 00:04:46.830
♪When regrets begin to turn around you
will hear it all♪

00:04:47.310 --> 00:04:50.330
♪Everything that leads me back to you♪

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:10.579
There's such a huge
breakthrough with the Minghui project,

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:12.100
so why didn't you tell me sooner?

00:05:21.940 --> 00:05:23.420
Mr. Raymond,

00:05:23.580 --> 00:05:25.940
weren't you quite confident?

00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:31.179
If I had known Minghui
had a technical breakthrough,

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:33.420
would I have terminated
the contract with them?

00:05:33.860 --> 00:05:35.940
And you're here asking me, huh?

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:37.179
Do you know,

00:05:37.180 --> 00:05:38.499
so far,

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:43.900
my losses are enough to lose
half my influence on the board?

00:05:57.700 --> 00:05:58.820
Mr. Raymond,

00:05:59.370 --> 00:06:01.169
the alliance between
Qingniao and Minghui

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:03.460
is swallowing our market share.

00:06:03.660 --> 00:06:04.860
Back then...

00:06:05.700 --> 00:06:08.300
The risk clauses in
Qingniao's compliance review

00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:11.380
were bargaining chips
agreed upon by both sides.

00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:14.980
As for the chain reaction
caused by technological iteration,

00:06:15.620 --> 00:06:17.900
it's every man for
himself in the business world.

00:06:18.180 --> 00:06:19.500
Is it not?

00:06:19.820 --> 00:06:23.300
Qingniao's legal department
has filed an anti-monopoly lawsuit.

00:06:35.900 --> 00:06:37.180
Mr. Raymond,

00:06:38.780 --> 00:06:41.380
what about the board? What should I do?

00:06:47.660 --> 00:06:50.980
You're not the only one
who has to handle a crisis now.

00:06:56.300 --> 00:06:59.180
The matter hasn't been resolved yet.

00:06:59.380 --> 00:07:02.500
You can't leave.

00:07:05.620 --> 00:07:08.540
What's your attitude?

00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:12.300
Mr. Shen,

00:07:13.020 --> 00:07:15.180
please tell your son
to manage his emotions.

00:07:16.380 --> 00:07:18.140
Under the current circumstances,

00:07:18.980 --> 00:07:21.300
violence won't solve
any of our problems.

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:28.700
Let go.

00:07:31.980 --> 00:07:33.940
I said let go!

00:07:33.980 --> 00:07:36.179
We've already lost.

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:37.779
This isn't over yet.

00:07:37.780 --> 00:07:39.819
How do you know we've lost?

00:07:39.820 --> 00:07:40.459
Let go!

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:42.379
A loss is a loss.

00:07:42.380 --> 00:07:44.019
You lost!

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:45.500
What about me?

00:07:48.180 --> 00:07:49.300
Dad!

00:07:51.380 --> 00:07:52.820
Dad!

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:54.470
Dad!

00:07:56.060 --> 00:07:58.379
Someone, help!

00:07:58.380 --> 00:08:01.900
Someone, help!

00:08:02.060 --> 00:08:03.420
Why don't you stay one more day?

00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:04.780
We can go back together tomorrow.

00:08:04.980 --> 00:08:06.859
After the press conference,

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:08.780
there's too much to handle.

00:08:08.860 --> 00:08:10.580
I can't leave it all to Grandfather.

00:08:16.740 --> 00:08:17.899
I'm going back tomorrow.

00:08:17.900 --> 00:08:19.100
Call me when you arrive.

00:08:22.620 --> 00:08:24.140
I'll be waiting for you at home.

00:08:28.100 --> 00:08:30.500
Alright, I'm off.

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:48.060
Goodbye.

00:09:06.020 --> 00:09:07.220
See you in Gang City.

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:55.300
What do you want?

00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:57.060
Don't you know

00:09:57.420 --> 00:09:59.020
what I want already?

00:10:09.300 --> 00:10:11.780
Wanxin should be back by now, right?

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:16.099
The driver went to
pick her up two hours ago.

00:10:16.100 --> 00:10:17.500
I'll give her a call.

00:10:20.630 --> 00:10:23.589
Hello, the number
you dialed is powered off.

00:10:23.590 --> 00:10:26.379
The user you dialed is powered off.

00:10:26.380 --> 00:10:28.420
What's going on?

00:10:35.140 --> 00:10:38.220
Hello, the number
you dialed is powered off.

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:41.340
What exactly is the situation?

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:47.099
(Qingniao Group)

00:10:47.100 --> 00:10:50.500
You've worked hard during this period.

00:10:50.780 --> 00:10:53.940
I want to say thank you to all of you.

00:10:56.700 --> 00:10:57.820
You've worked hard too.

00:10:59.900 --> 00:11:02.819
Qi Feng, the Spark system's
topology algorithm reconstruction

00:11:02.820 --> 00:11:04.500
will be handled by your team.

00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:07.500
- Alright.
- Alright, leave it to us.

00:11:08.300 --> 00:11:09.420
Rachel,

00:11:09.620 --> 00:11:11.300
regarding the group's follow-up matters,

00:11:11.660 --> 00:11:12.900
I'll have to count on you.

00:11:13.020 --> 00:11:14.140
I'm on it.

00:11:14.420 --> 00:11:16.259
I have another piece of good news.

00:11:16.260 --> 00:11:17.419
At 9:00 PM tonight,

00:11:17.420 --> 00:11:18.379
Dr. Sun Ru

00:11:18.380 --> 00:11:21.220
will fully connect to our system link.

00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:27.620
Rachel,

00:11:27.860 --> 00:11:28.499
due to

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:31.220
the issue with
our technical talent retention recently,

00:11:31.780 --> 00:11:32.979
for all security vulnerabilities,

00:11:32.980 --> 00:11:35.219
I've developed an SOP remediation plan.

00:11:35.220 --> 00:11:35.979
From now on,

00:11:35.980 --> 00:11:38.940
I'll ensure the safety of
every one of our key personnel.

00:11:41.620 --> 00:11:42.740
I'm sorry.

00:11:43.620 --> 00:11:46.300
Fortunately,
everything turned out perfectly.

00:11:46.780 --> 00:11:50.540
Miss Xu is the one who
deserves the most credit this time.

00:12:01.020 --> 00:12:02.940
Boss, it's Mr. Changhe.

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:06.940
Sorry, I need to take this.

00:12:09.220 --> 00:12:10.579
Shen Gu,

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:13.180
has Wanxin contacted you
since arriving in Gang City?

00:12:13.380 --> 00:12:15.300
I tried calling her,
but her phone is off.

